<i class=\"fa-solid fa-layer-group\"></i> Performans Yönetimi</div>\n0010:     <h1 class=\"bys-title\">Kategori ve Kapsam Yönetimi</h1>\n0011:     <p class=\"bys-sub\">Bu ekran, personel kategorilerini ve kategoriye bağlı performans kapsamlarını kurumsal bir şekilde yönetir. Kapsam hazırlıkları kişi detayı göstermeden özet üretir; yetkili kullanıcılar gerektiğinde detaylı ön izleme yapabilir.</p>\n0012:   </section>\n0013:   <div class=\"bys-grid\">\n0014:     <div class=\"bys-card\"><strong>Aktif Kategori</strong><b>{{ categories|length }}</b><span>Kullanılabilir kategori sayısı.</span></div>\n0015:     <div class=\"bys-card\"><strong>Atanmış Personel</strong><b>{{ summary.assigned_total }}</b><span>Kategori bağlantısı bulunan personel.</span></div>\n0016:     <div class=\"bys-card\"><strong>Hazır Kategori</strong><b>{{ summary.ready_category_count }}</b><span>Performans kapsamına alınabilir kategori.</span></div>\n0017:     <div class=\"bys-card\"><strong>Kapsam Taslağı</strong><b>{{ summary.draft_count }}</b><span>Aktif hazırlık kaydı.</span></div>\n0018:   </div>\n0019:   <section class=\"bys-section\">\n0020:     <h2>Kategori Yönetimi</h2>\n0021:     <div class=\"bys-two\">\n0022:       <form method=\"post\" style=\"display:grid;gap:12px;align-content:start\">\n0023:         {% if csrf_token is defined %}<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"{{ csrf_token() }}\">{% endif %}\n0024:         <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"create_category\">\n0025:         <label class=\"bys-label\">Yeni Kategori Adı<input class=\"bys-input\" name=\"display_name\" placeholder=\"Örn. Müze Personeli\"></label>\n0026:         <label class=\"bys-label\">Açıklama<textarea class=\"bys-textarea\" name=\"description\" placeholder=\"Bu kategorinin hangi personel grubunda kullanılacağını yazın.\"></textarea></label>\n0027:         <button class=\"bys-btn primary\" type=\"submit\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> Kategori Ekle</button>\n0028:       </form>\n0029:       <div>\n0030:         <table class=\"bys-table\">\n0031:           <thead><tr><th>Kategori</th><th>Durum</th><th>Bağlı Kayıt</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead>\n0032:           <tbody>\n0033:           {% for cat in all_categories %}\n0034:             <tr>\n0035:               <td><strong>{{ cat.display_name }}</strong><div class=\"bys-small\">{{ cat.description or 'Açıklama yok.' }}</div></td>\n0036:               <td><span class=\"bys-badge {{ 'ok' if cat.is_active else 'muted' }}\">{{ cat.status_label }}</span></td>\n0037:               <td>{{ cat.total_links }}<div class=\"bys-small\">Personel, kapsam veya dönem bağlantısı varsa geçmiş kayıt korunur.</div></td>\n0038:               <td class=\"bys-actions\">\n0039:                 {% if cat.is_active %}\n0040:                 <form method=\"post\" onsubmit=\"return confirm('Bu kategori silinsin mi? Bağlı kayıt varsa kategori pasife alınır ve geçmiş korunur.');\">{% if csrf_token is defined %}<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"{{ csrf_token() }}\">{% endif %}<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"delete_category\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"category_key\" value=\"{{ cat.category_key }}\"><button class=\"bys-btn danger\" type=\"submit\">{{ cat.delete_label }}</button></form>\n0041:                 {% else %}\n0042:                 <form method=\"post\">{% if csrf_token is defined %}<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"{{ csrf_token() }}\">{% endif %}<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"restore_category\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"category_key\" value=\"{{ cat.category_key }}\"><button class=\"bys-btn soft\" type=\"submit\">Aktifleştir</button></form>\n0043:                 {% endif %}\n0044:               </td>\n0045:             </tr>\n0046:           {% endfor %}\n0047:           </tbody>\n0048:         </table>\n0049:       </div>\n0050:     </div>\n0051:   </section>\n0052:   <section class=\"bys-section\">\n0053:     <h2>Kategori Kapsam Özeti</h2>\n0054:     <div class=\"bys-three\">\n0055:       {% for item in category_scopes %}\n0056:       <div class=\"bys-card\">\n0057:         <strong>{{ item.display_name }}</strong><span>{{ item.description or 'Kategori açıklaması bulunmuyor.' }}</span>\n0058:         <div style=\"margin-top:12px\" class=\"bys-actions\"><span class=\"bys-badge {{ 'ok' if item.scope_ready else 'warn' }}\">{{ 'Kapsama Hazır' if item.scope_ready else 'Atama Bekliyor' }}</span><span class=\"bys-badge muted\">{{ item.assignment_count }} personel</span></div>\n0059:         <form method=\"post\" style=\"display:grid;gap:10px;margin-top:14px\">\n0060:           {% if csrf_token is defined %}<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"{{ csrf_token() }}\">{% endif %}\n0061:           <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"create_scope_draft\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"category_key\" value=\"{{ item.category_key }}\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"visibility_mode\" value=\"summary_only\">\n0062:           <input class=\"bys-input\" type=\"text\" name=\"scope_name\" value=\"{{ item.display_name }} Kategori Kapsamı\">\n0063:           <button class=\"bys-btn soft\" type=\"submit\">Kapsam Taslağı Oluştur</button>\n0064:         </form>\n0065:       </div>\n0066:       {% endfor %}\n0067:     </div>\n0068:   </section>\n0069:   <section class=\"bys-section\">\n0070:     <h2>Aktif Kapsam Taslakları</h2>\n0071:     <table class=\"bys-table\">\n0072:       <thead><tr><th>Taslak</th><th>Kategori</th><th>Görünürlük</th><th>İşlem</th></tr></thead>\n0073:       <tbody>{% for draft in drafts %}<tr><td><strong>{{ draft.scope_name }}</strong></td><td>{{ draft.category_key }}</td><td>{{ label_status(draft.visibility_mode) }}</td><td><form method=\"post\">{% if csrf_token is defined %}<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"csrf_token\" value=\"{{ csrf_token() }}\">{% endif %}<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"deactivate_scope_draft\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"scope_key\" value=\"{{ draft.